  "note": "ScpClient.Upload and Download put the remote path into the scp command the server runs; on a shell-based server a path not quoted for that shell runs as a command. Present from 2011.12. An app that sets a RemotePathTransformation suited to its server is less exposed, and a code scan cannot see that setting.",
